@program qt6-text-input-test
@compositor kwin
@conf hime-edit-display=2
@conf hime-on-the-spot-key=1
# Qt 6 (text-input-v2 in KWin) moving to another line of the same window:
# KWin keeps the context but resets it, and the keys typed into the first
# line are dropped, as for GTK (kwin-switch).
--two b c @check <tab> @check a <space>
